        "Transfer the chicken to a cutting board to sit for 15 minutes before carving. Pour \u00bd cup water or broth into the roasting pan and place it over high heat. Scrape up the pan drippings with a wooden spoon. Reduce the pan juices to the desired consistency, and season to taste.",
